{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../InputPaidMediaVideo/", "title": "InputPaidMediaVideo"}, "next": {"link": "../ChosenInlineResult/", "title": "ChosenInlineResult"}, "title": "PaidMediaPurchased", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"paidmediapurchased\">\n<h1>PaidMediaPurchased<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#paidmediapurchased\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.PaidMediaPurchased\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PaidMediaPurchased</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.PaidMediaPurchased\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>This object contains information about a paid media purchase.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>from_user</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>) \u2013 User who purchased the media.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>paid_media_payload</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Bot-specified paid media payload.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/ChosenInlineResult", "ChosenInlineResult", "N", "next"], ["api/types/InputPaidMediaVideo", "InputPaidMediaVideo", "P", "previous"]], "s